This is a collection of YANIs by users of the #nethack IRC channel on
freenode.net.  Please excuse any old ideas that may be present.

[2]: On April first, if you hallucinate on the plane of air (or maybe
any plane), all of the monsters should appear to be snakes.

[3]: When you press , on a square that has many items on it, it should
show you the same menu you see when you press D

[4]: Follow the Leader: when you have multiple pets and you climb
stairs, not only should pets adjacent to you follow you but also pets
adjacent to pets that are adjacent to you (etc.).
[5]: ...either this should also work for teleportation, or it should
not... and if not, then we might redefine teleportation as a spell that
effects only the player's square and the immediately adjacent squares.
If that's the case, then items and monsters in the immediately adjacent
squares should be teleported as well.

[6]: You should be able to saddle any segment of a long worm. Pets
should also be able to ride. With enough saddles, you and your Archon
army can ride to battle on the same steed!

[7]: There should be longer engravings, like the whole description of
the planet Hoth, etc.

[8]: Breadcrumbs/footprints: every square you step on changes color so
you can retrace your steps and avoid traps.  These would persist even
if you are mindflayed or suffer from amnesia.  Perhaps they should time
out eventually though.  Maybe with a random factor too so after a while
your old trail will become a broken line, and finally there will be no
trace at all.

[9]: Give puddings a "critical mass".  When there are too many in one
place, they go BOOM!!, creating holes, and tears in the fabric of
space-time (magic portals and level teleporters).  Oh, and doing
massive damage to any unfortunate who happens to be in the middle of it
all....

[10]: Eating a wand should, if the wand has an equivelant spell, give
you knowledge of that spell for (charges)*(some constant) turns.

[11]: A "wait until fully healed or disturbed" command. Maybe if you do
n1234. to wait a long time it stops waiting when you become fully
healed. "You feel fully recovered. You stop waiting."

[12]: There should be an alternate victory sequence involving giving
the Amulet of Yendor to Izchak

[13]: [A]pplying certain weapons (frost brand, fire brand, etc) should
have the effect of similar wands or spells (e.g. freezing/evaporating
water).

[14]: If you wear a silver ring and engage in unarmed combat with
silver haters, it should deal silver damage on every second blow
instead of on every blow.

[15]: If, for instance, dlvl 5 is a bones level with a dragon (or other
big nasty) on it, then your little dog should refuse even to follow you
down the stairs until the dragon has been slain.

[16]: CoMR: carrying a centaur corpse should grant magic resistance.
GoP: carrying a gnome corpse should give a bonus to strength.  HoB:
carrying a giant/minotaur/ettin/titan corpse should give a bonus to
intelligence and wisdom.  WoW: invoking a blessed wraith corpse should
have a chance of granting a wish (consuming the corpse in the process).

